# Route: guide 18 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 38 to
# 40, 18 quests, 3.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Badlands): Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs -> Agmond's End -> Valley
# of Fangs -> The Maker's Terrace -> Agmond's End -> Kargath -> Apocryphan's
# Rest -> Kargath -> The Dustbowl -> Kargath -> The Dustbowl -> Valley of
# Fangs -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 1559 Flash Bomb
# Recipe; 2203 Badlands Reagent Run II; 5145 Dragonscale Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Find the Gems and Power Source (2339), Disharmony of Fire
# (3907), Commander Gor'shak (3981), The Rise of the Machines (4063), KILL ON
# SIGHT: Dark Iron Dwarves (4081), KILL ON SIGHT: High Ranking Dark Iron
# Officials (4082), Operation: Death to Angerforge (4132), Lost Thunderbrew
# Recipe (4134), Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), The Pack Mistress (4724), Kibler's
# Exotic Pets (4729), The Darkstone Tablet (4768), En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862),
# Warlord's Command (4903), Operative Bijou (4981).

